Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:04.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在逃避猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent my life running from hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不希望你和萨姆过这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this for you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还一起在天堂 而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were together in heaven, and now…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom… ‭w-what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole mom thing, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回来了 却又走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we get her back, and then she leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爷爷穷其一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather spent the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去追踪一个什么修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to track down something he called the Thule Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是个极扭曲秘密的社团\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were this twisted, secret fraternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一统世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell-bent on world domination,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,资助过早期纳粹党\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sponsored the early days of the nazi party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一页\N{\fnArial\fs30}This last page…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是所有死而复生的修黎社人的名册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a roster of every dead thule member who was reanimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就为这杀了我爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why they killed my grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个纳粹猪猡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nazi pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克·巴斯拉比 他自燃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One rabbi Isaac Bass… he spontaneously combusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,混账纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写了怎么干掉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything in there on how to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让一名修黎社的朋友死透\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want a friend of the Thule to stay dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把尸体烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}burn the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀不尽修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never kill all the Thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社 万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live… The thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:37.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄州 哥伦布）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳埃德太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Lloyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向早到 在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always early. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只谈正事 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All business. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,1931年 纯金\N{\fnArial\fs30}1931. Solid gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这工艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that craftsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 如今可再不做这么好的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma'am, they don't make them like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 事情有变数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, there has been a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,价格有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是「说好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you call it a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说是「谈判的开始」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it, uh, the start of negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么区别呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, tomato, tomahto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,价格不能低于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I couldn't let it go for less than, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,八万\N{\fnArial\fs30}80.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 但是你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not, but you folks are …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些玩意如痴如狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}are mad about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,个人而言 我看不出它的吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, personally, uh, I don't, uh, see the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你不想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're not interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是可以另找买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can always, uh, find a new buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在跟谁说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等其他人知道了我的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck finding that new buyer when the community finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你还能不能找到买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I've been treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,单子上的都买到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got everything on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 炒还是炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you thinkin', scrambled or fried?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really hungry right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're not that…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那馅饼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about some pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的 如果妈妈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. If Mom …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stop you right there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈需要空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mom needed her space,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I told you I'm cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你真不介意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「两人丧身神秘大火」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Two Killed in Mystery Fire""
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystery fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 只烧了尸体的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the kind that doesn't burn anything but the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So spontaneous combustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么 女巫 龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking? Uh, witch? Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 看啊 这老妇人 超有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Check it out. The old lady? Loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,史高治·麦克老鸭在钱堆里游泳的那种有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking Scrooge McDuck swimming in pools of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这样的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's a lady like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会凌晨3点去一间小破店\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing at some crap store at 3:00 a.m.?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写是古董店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it says it was an antique shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱人喜欢买古董 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, rich people like antiquing. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是现在 你真不想谈谈… - 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the meantime, you sure you don't wanna talk about - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这叫升华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's called sublimation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, it's kinda my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:27.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（古董 收藏品）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们错过了大部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we missed the calvary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们是不是该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we should go home then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那是第一位被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that's the first victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,史高治·麦克老鸭女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrooge McDuck lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这就是那位古董商了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes this the antiques dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 马文·布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Name was Marvin Brickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳏夫 这店开了几十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Widower. Owned the shop for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulphur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术袋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe hex bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 也或许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or, uh, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,古董店 净是老物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}antique shop, full of old stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这人拿到了什么受诅咒物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the guy got his hands on a cursed object…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,物件失控 就开始杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it went haywire, started killing everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那也不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude… - Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还是什么都别碰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}May…maybe let's not touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们搞清楚这些东西会不会想杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we figure out if this stuff wants to kill us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我好像有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个被害人遇害那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like the victims were meeting about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是为一块古董怀表见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}an antique pocket watch the night they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pocket watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 至少据马文的电邮是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, according to Marv's e-mail, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我黑入了马文的硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this … I hacked into Marv's hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他在经营\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it looks like he was conducting…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个地下生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an entire underground business,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门针对\N{\fnArial\fs30}catering to, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi nutjobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might wanna take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What are you, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来史高治·麦克老鸭女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Scrooge McDuck lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以收集纳粹的破烂为乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}got her rocks off by collecting Nazi crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,据马文的账簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, according to Marv's ledger,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀表是希特勒一名亲信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the watch belonged to a member of Hitler's inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 表呢 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where is it now? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方没有报告说发现怀表\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police didn't report finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大胆猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna go out on a limb here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,表可能既不在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and guess that it's probably not out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and probably not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟纳粹有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…Nazi connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The immolation M.O.?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去耳熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like anybody we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们来搅局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they crashed the party,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走了表 并烧死了在场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}took the watch, and torched the bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真讨厌他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真好玩 我从不这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is … this is fun. I-I don't really ever do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说 「提防约炮文化 艾莉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone's like, "Watch out for the hookup culture, Ellie."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们就是担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they just worry 'cause, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我刚结束一段恋情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just got out of a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我把戒指还回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but no, no, I gave … I gave back the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…这是好事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's just … that's all … that's a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 嗯 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Yeah, that was …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在摸索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm kinda still figuring out how the whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:09:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,陌陌这玩意怎么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, Tinder thing works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我可以更酷一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could … I could be cooler, let's be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你的胡子太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, you know, like, your beard, it's super cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想喝一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我要去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm gonna … I'm gonna use the, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}the little girls'…room and just…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 艾莉诺 他很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Eleanore. He is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要穿上「大姑娘」的「裤子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just … you put on those big girl pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后脱了他的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you take off his.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是普通裤子啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…regular pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是大姑娘的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not big girl pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干什么 艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语] 那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Das Madchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.87,0:11:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 我们得抓活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot! We need her alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有办法追踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have what we need to track her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,账簿我们已经进行一半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're halfway through the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干掉了六个 泥人干掉了其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I nailed six, and the golem got the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels good, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成犹大计划开启的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}finishing what the Judah Initiative started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爷爷会感到骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grandfather would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:05.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 大学辍学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, dropping out of college.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去消灭纳粹活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wipe out Nazi corpse-bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非我母亲的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't exactly my mother's dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说我们这边有修黎社活动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear about any Thule activity in our neck of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.49,0:12:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些德国混蛋都在父国活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Deutsch-nozzles have been sticking to the Fatherland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们集结了起来 很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're closing ranks. All jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是有什么情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what's cookin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么事 很重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了一些他们的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got our hands on a few of their documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务代号是「Das Blut」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code named the mission "Das Blut" …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「血」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Blood."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去美妙的不祥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… Wow, that sounds nice and ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.39,0:12:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们整个组织啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're talking the whole enchilada …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社最高指挥都聚集在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Thule High Command all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有块重要的怀表吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, does the, uh, this pocket watch mean anything to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纳粹遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi-relic wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,又发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another body just dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 我们得回头再打给你了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, we're gonna have to call you back, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们赶到 他已经烧成灰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time we got there, he was ash and bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么能把人弄成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that to a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有尸体 另一个受害人很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the body. The other victim was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逃走了 跑去了邻居家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got away, ran to her neighbor's,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}and called for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,生还者在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the survivor now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我已经录过口供了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? I already gave my statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. No. No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我走 来人 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out! Somebody, help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人救命啊 放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please! Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 我们得追上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - We gotta follow that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always wanted to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么对我 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this to me? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你想要什么我都给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, look, I-I will give you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有什么钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I-I don't really have any money,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我祖父母给我留下了股票\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my grandparents left me stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 告诉我究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just … just, please, tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你就不能闭嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Do you ever shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到她了 我到了 都锁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have her. I'm here now. It's all locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力了 我真努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I try with you, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你总希望我能参透你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you expect me to be a mind reader,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太累人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,家事最烦人了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, family drama's a bitch, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不是警察 那是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're not cops, then what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上有些不该存在的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things out there that shouldn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏东西 我们杀它们 算是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad things. We kill 'em. It's kind of our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在跟我们在一起最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so your safest place is with us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么会伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹僵尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Necromancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用血魔法让自己能几乎永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use blood magic to make themselves almost immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果爆头 焚尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you shoot 'em in the head, set 'em on fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是能杀死它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that usually does the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 你看到他们怎么对你朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, you saw what they did to your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要杀尼克 为什么要绑架我\N{\fnArial\fs30}why … why would they kill Nick? And why kidnap me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些问题问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are great questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群混蛋要那表做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you tools want with the watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切跟她有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does it have to do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Want to, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好 我们去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. All right, let's go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不行 你们不能打死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No. No. You can't just shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, sure I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我经常这么干 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, I do it all the time. - Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! All right, all right. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我父亲的 纳哈斯指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to my father. Commandant Nauhaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社最高指挥官之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thule High Command? Ranking officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没那么难吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that wasn't so hard now, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 他会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. He'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这是给你挠痒痒用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think this is, a tickle party?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是战争结束时开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started at the end of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:30.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联包围了元首地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Soviets had surrounded the Fuhrerbunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道已经没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knew it was over …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone except my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:15.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（还有别的办法）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 跳过前戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, skip the foreplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸把希特勒怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your dad do to Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了他的灵魂 不是比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he saved his soul. Like, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表 就像魂器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The watch, it's like a … it's like a horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.21,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利·波特》梗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Harry Potter thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you would know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 表装着希特勒的灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways…so the watch holds Hitler's soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把希特勒的灵魂困在了一块怀表里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you trapped Hitler's soul in a pocket watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么 保存吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that? For safekeeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是为了复活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. To bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次听时也觉得是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded bonkers to me the first time I heard it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time you heard it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时没在场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我是94年在水牛城出生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. Man, I was born in Buffalo in '94.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 「复活希特勒」的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, this whole "Let's bring Hitler back"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经由来已久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more of an O.G. Thule plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们成天说个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they do is yap about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在开玩笑吧 这是玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's joking, right? Right? This is … this is a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 咱们再回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait. Let's just … let's back up to the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸打算复活阿道夫·希特勒的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}where your dad is going to resurrect Adolph Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开地堡后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷将希特勒灵魂运出去的修黎社特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Thule agents who were smuggling Hitler's soul out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭到了苏联人的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}got whacked by Soviets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你们把表丢了 - 不是我丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you lost the watch. - Hey, I didn't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,表落入了一个俄罗斯家庭手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ended up with some Russian family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后修黎社追踪它到了中国 然后是秘鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the Thule tracked it to China and then to Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就到了那家古董店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it wound up in that antique shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们现在都群情高昂地想复活元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now they're all hyped to get their Fuhrer-resurrection on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是开玩笑 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a joke. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打算怎么复活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do they plan on bringing him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒的灵魂只能寄居在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soul of Hitler can only inhabit the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有他血脉的人的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}of somebody who possesses his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的血 Das blut\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blood. Das blut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理理清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社想把希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule want to upload Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传到他一个亲戚的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the body of one of his relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有亲戚活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they even exist anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边就有一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你觉得我跟希特勒有血缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait. You think I'm related to Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这太好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, that … that … that is just hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这辈子他们都在留意你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been keeping tabs on you your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社追踪所有希特勒的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule track all of Hitler's descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰巧跟表在一个州\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just happen to be in the same state as the watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多巧 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go figure. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 我妈妈 她追溯我们家谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. Okay, my mom, she … she tracked our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能追溯到五月花号\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way back to the Mayflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说 - 你是领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She said - You're adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.30,0:19:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自伊利诺伊州 惠顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from Wheaton, Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年参加马拉松\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-state cross-country all four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会使用网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, way to use the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学做医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trained to become a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第一次看到尸体后就辍学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you dropped out at the sight of your first stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am taking a sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你婚礼前两天逃婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dipped town two days before your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我们的餐饮商上床了 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was banging our caterer! You…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎特别喜欢跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems as though this running is a thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.36,0:19:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我去追她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta move. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给我妈发短信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, uh, texted my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我是不是领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked if I was adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 「亲爱的 给我们打电话」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wrote, "Honey, call us."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人刚把我的生活搅得天翻地覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy out there just flipped my life inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就花了五秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}in, like, five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.37,0:20:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 我知道你现在大概是这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, I know it probably feels like that right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你应付得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻浮我应付得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a little flighty, I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跟史上最大的种族屠杀疯子有血缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being related to the biggest genocidal maniac of all time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,未必吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近真是热得要命 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been crazy hot lately, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球变暖什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That global warming…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.14,0:21:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在你很难相信 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to believe this right now, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will get easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也有人想用你来复活阿道夫·希特勒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Did someone wanna use you to resurrect Adolph Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, w… No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们想要我复活路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they did want me to bring back Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was his vessel …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒我差点就信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost, almost had me with Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但路西法 不是吧 魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lucifer? Really? The Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, okay? I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 崩溃结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, meltdown time's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你现在就得去面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you need to face this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你信不信 我们现在占优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not, we actually have the upper hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,据那位小混蛋说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to, uh, you know, Junior Jackass in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Thule want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们可以利用 来做个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can use that. We can set a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想用我当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you wanna use me as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是想用你当诱饵 艾莉 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to use you as bait, Ellie, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有机会一次性消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the opportunity to take out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个修黎社最高指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}the entire Thule High Command in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去吓人吗 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now does that sound scary? Yeah, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有时候 你该跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are times when you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 你要留下抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are times when you stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.81,0:22:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是抗争的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is one of those times when you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保证会确保你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we promise that we will keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.22,0:22:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在里面 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're in there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Verstanden?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤 她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruckzug! Sie ist auf der Flucht!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.06,0:24:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.19,0:24:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}She's still not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.09,0:24:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 或许她吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awesome. - Maybe she got spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.80,0:25:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是就知道跑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't running a whole thing with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.31,0:25:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是艾莉 你知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Ellie. You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 还是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, it's Sam Winchester. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.57,0:25:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这希特勒的事让人糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know all this Hitler stuff is confusing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我保证我们能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I promise we can explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.06,0:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回电话 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call me back. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把希特勒的事告诉他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you tell them about Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以解释 - 被犹大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can explain - It wasn't bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.56,0:25:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他讨厌的泥人追杀还不够糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}being hunted by the Judah and his revolting golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在拖时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们会杀了我 带走她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would've killed me and taken her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.21,0:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该感谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本该是我的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to be my heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.05,0:25:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 你总是不断让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, you're an inconceivable disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.79,0:25:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前很敬仰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to look up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.81,0:25:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你征服了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You conquered death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了那么多事 但现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did so many things. But now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.33,0:25:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你只想重温跟希特勒的光荣岁月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all you wanna do is relive your glory days with Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这一代 千禧一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your generation … you millennials …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太软弱 无法掌控未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}are too weak to steward the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.04,0:25:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要更坚定的人来掌舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs a stronger hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界在分裂 燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is divided und inflamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国的陨落 经济的衰退\N{\fnArial\fs30}This falling of empires, the flailing of economies,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说现在是元首回归的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is precisely why there has never been a better time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.97,0:26:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,最佳时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Fuhrer's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.76,0:26:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.22,0:26:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.16,0:26:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.15,0:26:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.59,0:26:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁救救我 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me, please! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:29.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（家常菜）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.56,0:26:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 肯定有追踪咒可用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's gotta be a tracking spell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.89,0:26:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 如果我们有东西可拿来追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe if we had something to track.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.61,0:26:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们黑入城内所有交通监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we hack every traffic light in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.11,0:26:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始净化仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin the purification ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.59,0:27:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,已派侦察队去找温家兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A patrol has been sent to find the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.15,0:27:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷茨 我儿子今天累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fritz, my son has had a very trying day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.53,0:27:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Hey, no I'm … What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.73,0:27:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off me, assclown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.36,0:27:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.88,0:27:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 我们可以听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong! We can do it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.95,0:27:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.41,0:27:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷茨 你不用这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fritz, look, you don't have to do this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.84,0:27:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.79,0:27:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 求你 你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, please, you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.09,0:27:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷茨 回话 弗雷茨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fritz. Come in, Fritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟的英帕拉停在一家餐馆外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters' Impala parked outside diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.96,0:27:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,锯木厂路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sawmill Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.69,0:28:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.11,0:28:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我完全不知道该怎么找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I-I mean, I have no idea how we're gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.42,0:28:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we look at…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想找到艾莉 就得保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna find Ellie, you have to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.31,0:28:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we believe anything you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.81,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,街对面有个修黎社特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the street, there's a Thule agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在外面垃圾桶旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}right beside the dumpster outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.97,0:28:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚杀了我爸一个手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just killed one of my dad's guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.20,0:28:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道父亲是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.18,0:28:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹巫师是什么感觉吗 非常糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have a Nazi necromancer for a father? It sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.16,0:28:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节别提了 学校职业日更是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas was a joke. Career Day at school was a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.51,0:29:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直只想让他骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I do is try to make him proud,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.90,0:29:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我永远不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫一个叫弗雷茨的人杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked a guy named Fritz to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.40,0:29:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听你说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.79,0:29:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你们去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take you to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你去开车 我收拾那德国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you get the car, I'll take care of the Kraut.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.45,0:29:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.56,0:29:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.91,0:29:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子到底还有点种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has some spine after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.46,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗日后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christoph's time will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.69,0:29:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有更要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have more important business.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you always loved this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.89,0:29:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦格纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wagner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让元首这样渐渐接受这新世界再合适不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perfect way to ease der Fuhrer into this new century.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sehr gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Hey, what … what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.00,0:30:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们要把我丢在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're just gonna leave me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.19,0:30:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, pretty much. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.81,0:30:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 外面两个 里面不知道有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got two outside and who knows how many inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.69,0:30:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.63,0:30:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.86,0:30:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们得悄悄行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we need to be stealth, do this quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.88,0:31:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.01,0:31:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.65,0:31:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有机会的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get a chance. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.32,0:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去杀纳粹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go kill some Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.19,0:31:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.75,0:31:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fuher's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须占据一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}must occupy a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.91,0:31:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,流着他的血液的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}that contains the blood of his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.17,0:31:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.31,0:31:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让史上最伟大的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd resurrect the greatest man who ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.35,0:31:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活进入一个软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the body of a weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:32:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,配不上他的美国女人的身体里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}unworthy, American female?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.59,0:32:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mein Gott.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.71,0:32:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never needed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.94,0:32:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}only your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.60,0:32:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.02,0:33:40.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等了好久啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hans?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.63,0:34:06.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你看上去真棒）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.26,0:34:10.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一点没老）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.99,0:34:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolfgang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.94,0:34:22.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你妻子怎么样了）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.90,0:34:30.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（她大概已经死了）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:49.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（过来 帅哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.65,0:34:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.04,0:35:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't…be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.13,0:35:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的曾曾侄孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great-great-grandniece.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.83,0:35:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的馈赠 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the gift, Liebchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.36,0:35:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么处理她 元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall we do with her, Fuhrer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽干她的血 然后喂狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the rest of her blood, then give her to the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.34,0:35:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但元首 我们没有狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Fuhrer, we have no dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.72,0:35:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢狗狗 汪汪汪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love doggies. Woof, woof, woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.75,0:35:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫冈 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolfgang, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.30,0:35:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该带上榴弹发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've just brought the grenade launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.94,0:35:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 你挺喜欢这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it, though, you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.85,0:36:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.81,0:36:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是年度最佳父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it isn't Father of the Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.29,0:36:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对元首放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Address den Fuhrer with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.57,0:36:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuhrer?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.85,0:36:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam und Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.67,0:36:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很重要 他怕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be important. He feared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.89,0:36:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳哈斯 他还在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nauhaus. Still up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.27,0:36:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是件不错的新皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice new meat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次有俩蛋蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It come with two testicles this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.81,0:36:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我喜欢的诸多升级之一 比如这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of many upgrades I'm enjoying. Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.43,0:36:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像把一个小戈培尔揣在我兜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like having a tiny Goebbels in my pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:03.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,我卖掉了一千万本《我的奋斗》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold 10 million copies of "Mein Kampf."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.45,0:37:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我能在推特上掀起多大热潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I can do with Twitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.96,0:37:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my plane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.68,0:37:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好了 元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost ready, Fuhrer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.46,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.09,0:37:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么处理他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall we do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.79,0:37:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很喜欢把他们介绍给我新养的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall very much enjoy introducing them to my new dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.52,0:37:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.00,0:37:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.74,0:37:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你再万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.16,0:38:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.83,0:38:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.67,0:38:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.99,0:38:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I killed Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.31,0:38:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这一点足以让我一辈子免费喝酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that entitles me to free drinks for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.55,0:38:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去印T恤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get t-shirts made.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.08,0:38:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道没人会相信你的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know no one's gonna believe you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.09,0:38:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你信我啊 你可是在场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you believe me. You were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.51,0:38:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们不杀我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up, you're not gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.28,0:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀 说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.32,0:38:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 你有更大的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you got bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:38:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,修黎社的剩余成员将永远追杀你这个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thule that are left are gonna hunt you as a traitor forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.45,0:39:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此的建议是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.22,0:39:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如回水牛城吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you head back to Buffalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.46,0:39:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会去水牛城的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody goes to Buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.03,0:39:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.81,0:39:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚火化了一堆纳粹僵尸的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, we just burned a pile of dead Nazi zombie bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.25,0:39:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个还是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of which I killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.01,0:39:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这也许是我第三糟的一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe, like, third worst day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.44,0:39:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近过得挺悲催的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a rough time lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.25,0:39:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 然后又发生了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and then all this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna be okay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.17,0:39:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我八成应该给我妈打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably call my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.59,0:39:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再逃避了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can only run for so long, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你觉得哪个更难一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what do you think is harder,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.29,0:39:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对希特勒再生\N{\fnArial\fs30}facing the reincarnation of Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.73,0:39:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是回去上医学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}or going back to med school?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.77,0:39:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我会选希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I gotta say Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think … I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.36,0:39:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.39,0:40:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好好保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh… take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.66,0:40:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.84,0:40:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.54,0:40:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinkin'…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.51,0:40:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进城的时候我们经过了一家面包店\N{\fnArial\fs30}We passed a bakery on the way into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.96,0:40:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌子上写着「方圆一千里最好的馅饼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign said, "Best pie for a thousand miles""
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.01,0:40:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想吃馅饼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you want pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.81,0:40:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.71,0:40:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我理应吃点馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I deserve some pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过希特勒是我杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention I killed Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要念叨一辈子了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna hear the end of this, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
